/* 114 年疼痛專科歷屆考題。請保留原始題號與官方答案；醫學驗證另行記錄。 */
window.PAIN_EXAM_SEEDS=(window.PAIN_EXAM_SEEDS||[]).concat([{"id":"official-114-1","year":114,"number":1,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which of the following is not true about post-mastectomy pain?","options":["Mastectomy may result in chronic pain in as many as half of those patients.","This pain often starts immediately or a few days postoperatively.","This pain is usually neuropathic in character.","It is suspected that the intercostobrachial nerve is often damaged during axillary node dissection","The incidence of phantom breast syndrome 1 year after surgery is less than 5%."],"officialAnswer":"E","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 E。Mastectomy 後慢性神經病變樣疼痛並不少見，intercostobrachial nerve 在腋下手術可能受損，因此 A–D 符合典型風險與臨床特徵。E 將一年後 phantom breast syndrome 發生率說成低於 5% 不妥；須分清 phantom breast sensation 與 phantom breast pain，且不同研究定義會影響比率。","officialNote":"","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":1,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-2","year":114,"number":2,"topic":"未分類","text":"下列關於 lateral femoral cutaneous nerve (LFCN) 的敘述，何者正確：","options":["來自腰神經叢的 L2, L3 神經根，支配大腿前外側的感覺功能，及股外側肌(Vastus lateralis) 的運動功能","此神經在經過腸骨脊(iliac crest)上方時，容易被壓迫引起「擠壓神經痛」 (entrapment neuralgia)，可能原因包括：懷孕、肥胖、腹腔腫瘤、穿戴厚重鉛衣或腰帶、長期坐位或 站立、甚至骨科髖關節置換手術後等","神經病變症狀包括 感覺喪失或低下(sensory loss or hypoesthesia)、異常感覺(dyeesthesia)、 或疼痛；一般單側發生，很少見雙腳同時出現","理學檢查包括 pelvic compression test 和 Ober’s test，或以神經學 EMG, SSEP 確認","LFCN neuralgia 又被稱為 meralgia paresthetica"],"officialAnswer":"E","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 E。LFCN 是 L2–L3 來源、經 ASIS 附近腹股溝韌帶下方的純感覺神經；受壓造成 meralgia paresthetica。A 沒有 vastus lateralis 運動功能；B 解剖壓迫位置不是 iliac crest 上方；C 雖多單側仍可雙側；D Ober test 是 IT band 評估，標準 EMG 也未必能診斷純小感覺神經受壓。","officialNote":"解釋：(A) LFCN 是 pure sensory; (B) 經過 inguinal ligament 接近 ASIS 處 (C) 20% 雙側發生 (D) Ober test 是 iliotibial band 的 PE, 而 LFCN 的 EMG 大多為正常 考題出處：Page 3759-63; Bonica's Management of Pain Fifth Edition, 2019.;","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":1,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-3","year":114,"number":3,"topic":"未分類","text":"關於鞭索傷害 (Whiplash injury) 造成的急性頸部疼痛，一般預後不錯。但根據統計，大約 有多少比率造成慢性的頸部疼痛：","options":["5%","10%","25%","50%","< 2%"],"officialAnswer":"C","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 C（約 25% 為原教材引用估計）。Whiplash-associated disorders 可從急性恢復轉為持續頸痛，但後續症狀比例依追蹤時間、族群、診斷與『慢性』定義有大幅變動。A 5% 和 E <2% 過低、D 50% 偏向不同廣義持續症狀估計；不是所有研究都恰為 25%。考試依原卷 C，臨床應辨識不確定區間。","officialNote":"解釋： 考題出處：Page 3835; Bonica's Management of Pain Fifth Edition, 2019.","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":1,"parseWarning":["25% 是特定舊研究值，慢性 whiplash 定義與追蹤時間可能不同"],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-4","year":114,"number":4,"topic":"未分類","text":"急性下背痛需要很快鑑別診斷出可能的 red flag，因此需要 “red flag check list”作為協助。 下列哪一項關於 check list 敘述較不正確：","options":["check list 內容，除了診斷參考，還可以作為急性背痛癒後程度的預測","check list 內容，須包括感染、發燒、免疫功能","check list 內容，須包括外傷、手術、長期使用類固醇","check list 內容，須包括職業、興趣、旅遊史、接觸史","check list 內容，須包括腫瘤、體重變化、腫瘤治療史"],"officialAnswer":"A","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 A。Red flags 是要排除骨折、感染、惡性腫瘤或馬尾症候群等重大病因，不是單獨有效的長期預後評分。B 感染與免疫風險、C 外傷／類固醇、E 腫瘤病史／不明體重減輕均重要；D 職業、接觸與旅遊資訊對部分鑑別診斷有輔助價值，但並非每個 low-back-pain red-flag checklist 的必列項。","officialNote":"解釋：(A) 無法作為癒後程度的預測；考題出處：page 3866; Page 1260-1264; Bonica's Management of Pain Fifth Edition, 2019","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":2,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-5","year":114,"number":5,"topic":"未分類","text":"According to the long-form McGill Pain Questionnaire (MPQ) pain rating index scores, which of the following acute pain status is rated the highest pain score?","options":["Amputation of digit","Labor pain","Abdominal gynecological surgery","Fracture.","Lower abdominal surgery (males)"],"officialAnswer":"A","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 A。題目引用舊版 long-form McGill Pain Questionnaire 的群體 pain rating index 排名，手指截肢的受測樣本分數被列得高於產痛、婦科腹部手術、骨折與男性下腹部手術，因此選 A。這是特定量表、樣本與研究的比較，**不是各類傷害固有的客觀疼痛排名**，個體差異極大。","officialNote":"","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":2,"parseWarning":["MPQ 分數排名依特定群體樣本，不是絕對疼痛定律"],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-6","year":114,"number":6,"topic":"未分類","text":"關於腰椎盤因性背痛(discogenic back pain)，以下的敘述何者較正確？","options":["診斷標準中，MRI 影像必須出現椎間盤的 HIZ (high intensity zone)","腰椎 CT 電腦斷層出現椎盤上下椎體在 T1WI 灰黑色，T2WI 出現亮白色，代表椎體水腫， 定義為 Modic Type 1 病變","盤因性疼痛病人，一般不會出現慢性背痛加放射性下肢痛","根據國際脊椎介入學會 2013 年的定義，椎盤注射誘發的再現性疼痛 (concordant pain)，盤 內壓力必須達到大於 20 psi (0.14 kPa) 以上","目前研究顯示，椎盤內診斷性注射的效度(validity)不高，容易出現偽陽性"],"officialAnswer":"B","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"disputed","explanation":"官方 B 的病理概念正確，但影像名稱有明顯筆誤：Modic type 1 為 **MRI** T1 低、T2 高訊號（發炎／骨髓水腫樣變化），CT 不會有 T1WI/T2WI。A HIZ 不是必要條件；C discogenic pain 可能轉移至腿；D 低壓 provocative discography 的概念不是 >20 psi，且單位換算也不正確；E 診斷性 discography 的效度及偽陽性率受嚴格選案影響，不能一概否定。此題保留官方 B 並註明題面有誤。","officialNote":"解釋：(A) HIZ 比率約 20-30 % 病人；(C) 仍有可能出現放射性痛；(D) 小於 20 psi; (E) 效度 高，偽陽性機會 < 10% 考題出處：Page 3926-7; Bonica's Management of Pain Fifth Edition, 2019","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"},{"title":"BACPAC MRI Modic changes 2023","url":"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10403314/"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":2,"parseWarning":["B 選項把 CT 與 MRI T1WI/T2WI 混用，原題可能有筆誤，需核對影像學敘述","CT 與 MRI T1/T2 混用，官方 B 字面錯誤"],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-7","year":114,"number":7,"topic":"未分類","text":"對慢性下背痛進行脊椎融合手術的早期研究，雖然宣稱具有高成功率，但一直具有爭議。 且近年來不同的研究，往往顯示不一樣的結論。可能的原因，下列何者比較正確？","options":["早期研究，往往不是隨機對照型研究 (RCT study)","對結果的呈現，採用定性方式 (例如：很好、好、普通、差)，而非定量的數據","缺少術前的基礎數據做比較","手術預後的數據分析，沒有根據病情的種類或狀態做分類","以上皆對"],"officialAnswer":"E","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 E。早期 spinal fusion 研究常欠隨機分派（A）、使用主觀等級而非標準化量化結果（B）、缺術前基準資料（C），又未依疼痛病因／病患狀態分層（D）。這些都會使觀察到的改善混入選擇偏差、回歸平均與治療期待，故 E『以上皆對』。較新的外科 RCT 仍須注重患者選擇與長期功能。","officialNote":"解釋：考題出處：Page 3974; Bonica's Management of Pain Fifth Edition, 2019","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":3,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-8","year":114,"number":8,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which of the following symptom is not often seen in patients with physical dependence (abstinence syndrome -(withdrawal) ) ?","options":["abdominal cramps","constipationn","vomiting","pupil dilatation","sweating"],"officialAnswer":"B","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 B。Opioid withdrawal 可有腹絞痛、噁心嘔吐、瞳孔放大、出汗及腹瀉等自主神經亢進徵象；**便祕**較典型是使用 opioid 時的副作用，不是停藥戒斷的常見表現，因此選 B。戒斷（physical dependence）不等於成癮（opioid use disorder）。","officialNote":"","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":3,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-9","year":114,"number":9,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which statement about spinal cord nociceptive processing is wrong?","options":["spinothalamic tract, located within the ventrolateral white matter of the spinal cord, has been demonstrated en route to supraspinal sites with the predominant path for axonal projections traveling to the ipsilateral ventrobasal thalamus in responses to most somatic noxious stimuli","spinothalamic tract neurons have demonstrated a predominance for neurons processing nociceptive information","the soma of postsynaptic dorsal column neurons are located predominantly in lamina III, IV, and X, and the neurons have been demonstrated to be responsive to both somatic and visceral nociceptive inputs","glutamate is the primary excitatory amino acid neurotransmitter in afferent nociception","descending noradrenergic and serotonergic fibers originating in the brainstem produce inhibitory or excitatory effects on second-order spinal neurons, therefore serve as the mechanisms of descending inhibition or facilitation"],"officialAnswer":"A","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 A。Spinothalamic tract 傳遞的軀體痛溫訊息多在脊髓交叉後沿對側 anterolateral system 上行至丘腦，A 所說主要投射 ipsilateral ventrobasal thalamus 錯。B 主述神經元與 nociception 有關；C postsynaptic dorsal column neurons 可參與深部／內臟訊息；D glutamate 是主要快興奮性傳遞物；E descending serotonergic／noradrenergic pathways 可抑制亦可促通。","officialNote":"Source: P43-45, Chapter 4: Substrates of spinal cord nociceptive processing. Edited by Ballantyne JC, Fishman SM, and Rathmell JP. 2019. Wolters Kluwer. Spinothalamic tract is located within the ventrolateral white matter of the spinal cord. Both ipsilateral and contralateral localization of axon pathways have been demonstrated en route to supraspinal sites, but the predominant path for axonal projections traveling to the ventrobasal thalamus resides on the contralateral side.","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":3,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-10","year":114,"number":10,"topic":"未分類","text":"關於疼痛評估方法論，以下敘述何者錯誤？","options":["在疼痛強度指數中，Numerical Rating Scale (NRS)的評估效力最高，缺點最少","Verbal Rating Scale (VRS)可用於難以明確使用 NRS 的民眾，例如年長者或認知能力較差 的民眾","DN4 questionnaire 是用於評估情緒面向 outcome 的量表","關於疼痛的時間性(temporal pattern)，連續性疼痛的 functional outcome 比間歇性疼痛的病 人更差","疼痛部位的描述通常使用 pain drawings 或 pain site checklist"],"officialAnswer":"C","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 C。DN4 是 neuropathic pain screen／診斷輔助問卷，詢問燒灼、電擊、麻木等神經病變特徵，不是用來量化情緒 outcome。A NRS 實用且常較易完成，但說『效力最高、缺點最少』是教材偏好而非放諸四海真理；B VRS 適合部分高齡者；D 疼痛時間型態與功能受損相關；E pain drawings／checklist 可記錄部位。","officialNote":"(DN4 用於區分 neuropathic pain vs. nonneuropathic pain) Reference: Ch. 20, conclusion","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":4,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-11","year":114,"number":11,"topic":"未分類","text":"The spinal cord is anatomically organized in laminae. Which statement is wrong?","options":["spinal dorsal horn neurons receiving excitatory inputs from nociceptive afferents throughout the dorsal horn but with particular localization to laminae I, II, V, VI, and X","small unmyelinated C fiber nociceptor endings for cutaneous somatic sensation are distributed mainly in laminae I and II, while for deep visceral afferents are distributed in ipsilateral laminae I, II, V, and X or contralateral V and X","large myelinated A-β fibers carries non-nociceptive input terminate in laminae III-V","noradrenergic and serotonergic inputs and inhibitory neurons with glycinergic and GABAergic enzymes are present in lamina V","estimated up to 25% of all spinothalamic neurons have been identified primarily nociceptive-specific neurons with small cutaneous receptive fields"],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 D，須對照 Bonica 章節文字。背角 lamina I、II、V 等參與 nociceptive processing；C fibers 多至 I–II，較粗 Aβ 傳入常止於 III–V，故 A–C 有生理根據。下降 NE/5-HT 與 GABA/glycine 抑制系統在背角不同層分布，D 將特定組合侷限於 lamina V 可能不符原書表述。E 的比例是特定神經生理研究估計，非普遍定值。本題標示待核對原圖層分布。","officialNote":"Source: P39-41, Chapter 4: Substrates of spinal cord nociceptive processing. Edited by Ballantyne JC, Fishman SM, and Rathmell JP. 2019. Wolters Kluwer. Neurons in lamina X are arranged around the central canal of the spinal cord. They receive bilateral inputs of unmyelinated, poorly myelinated, and highly myelinated afferents. Peptidergic inputs are extensive and immunohistochemical localization of noradrenergic and serotonergic inputs have been identified. Inhibitory neurons with immunohistochemical identification of glycinergic and GABAergic enzymes are locally present","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":4,"parseWarning":["lamina V 抑制性神經傳入表述需對照原書，可能有多個可爭論選項"],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-12","year":114,"number":12,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which of the following combination of lesion site with referral site describing pain referral is not common in cancer patients suffering from cancer pain?","options":["(Diaphragmatic irritation) and (Shoulder)","(Urothelial tract) and (Inguinal region and genitalia)","(C7–T1 vertebrae) and (Interscapular)","(L1–2) and (Sacroiliac joint and hip)","all of the above are common found in patients with cancre pain"],"officialAnswer":"E","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 E。題目列舉皆屬癌痛可見的 referred pain：膈肌刺激經 phrenic C3–5 轉移肩部（A），輸尿管／泌尿上皮病灶可至鼠蹊／生殖器（B），C7–T1 病灶可對應肩胛間痛（C），L1–2 病灶可牽涉薦髂與髖區（D）。因此 E 表示『A–D 都可能』。牽涉痛來源需結合神經檢查和影像，不能只憑疼痛部位斷言病灶。","officialNote":"考題出處： Chapter 73 –Cancer Pain Assessment and Syndromes / Table 73-1, page 1040","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":5,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-13","year":114,"number":13,"topic":"未分類","text":"The innervation of deep somatic tissue like muscle and joint is quite complex. Which of the following description is not appropriate?","options":["The nociceptors are predominantly activated by non-physiological stimuli which may cause damage to the structures (e.g. overload, twisting, strong pressure, ischemic contraction).","During inflammation or after trauma, nociceptors of joint and muscle show pronounced sensitization, in particular for mechanical stimuli.","Descending inhibition is enhanced during chronic inflammation but seems to be normalized during acute inflammation.","Both primary afferent fibers as well as sympathetic reflexes may aggravate inflammatory lesions.","Reduced release of hormones from the hypothalamic-pituitary-adrenal (HPA) axis such as cortisol, adrenal androgens and testosterone may cause a relative loss of anti-inflammatory activity."],"officialAnswer":"C","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 C。慢性發炎與神經傷害可導致下降抑制功能減弱、甚至促痛增強，C 宣稱慢性發炎時 descending inhibition 反而增強並與急性時相反，並非典型機制。A 關節肌肉 nociceptors 回應傷害刺激；B 發炎時機械敏化；D 交感反射與初級傳入可促進發炎；E HPA 軸抗發炎荷爾蒙降低可能影響慢性發炎。","officialNote":"考題出處： P.621","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":5,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-14","year":114,"number":14,"topic":"未分類","text":"關於鴉片類藥物的敘述，下列何者最不正確？","options":["Codeine 在肝臟中經 cytochrome P450 2D6 進行 O-demethylation 後會產生 morphine","Tramadol 屬於 weak opioid 類藥物，口服生物利用率（oral bioavailability）差，對 neuropathic pain 和 fibromyalgia 效用不佳","Tramadol 造成嚴重呼吸抑制的風險極低，但嚴重腎功能障礙或嚴重藥物過量時仍可能發 生","Oxycodone 的口服生物利用率比 morphine 高，且比較沒有 active metabolite 的疑慮","肝腎功能障礙對於 methadone 的代謝清除率（clearance）並沒有明顯的影響"],"officialAnswer":"B","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"disputed","explanation":"官方 B。Tramadol 是弱 μ agonism 加上 5-HT/NE reuptake inhibition，口服吸收不差，且對部分神經病變痛有止痛作用；所以 B『生物利用率差、完全效用不佳』不正確。A Codeine 藉 CYP2D6 O-demethylation 轉成 morphine；C 呼吸抑制仍可能發生，尤以藥物交互作用／腎障礙；D Oxycodone 口服利用率較 morphine 高；E methadone 清除受肝功能、交互作用影響，不能無條件說不受影響，故本題另標此潛在瑕疵。","officialNote":"","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":5,"parseWarning":["E methadone 清除與肝功能相關，過度絕對；不一定只有 B 錯"],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-15","year":114,"number":15,"topic":"未分類","text":"關於肌筋膜疼痛(Myofascial pain syndrome, MPS)的敘述，何者正確？","options":["臨床上病人如有反覆發生同一部位 MPS 的狀況，也有可能是更深部結構病變引起的 referred pain","除了局部肌筋膜的問題以外，肌筋膜疼痛還牽涉到 peripheral sensitization，但與 central sensitization 較無關聯","脈衝式高頻熱凝治療是治療肌筋膜疼痛的首選工具","肌筋膜疼痛的診斷是透過超音波影像觀察肌筋膜的形態學變化來確認","最新臨床實證已發現 Trigger point injection 效果及穩定度不佳，目前已不建議使用"],"officialAnswer":"A","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 A。反覆固定位置的『肌筋膜痛』可能是脊椎關節、神經根、內臟或其他深層病變轉移痛，需重新評估，不能只針對 trigger point 治療。B MPS 亦可能牽涉 central sensitization；C pulse RF 非公認首選；D 超音波不能作單一確診標準；E trigger point injection 在適當選案仍有使用情境，療效證據需要分別評估。","officialNote":"Reference: Ch 35, myofascial pain","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":6,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-16","year":114,"number":16,"topic":"未分類","text":"關於三叉神經痛(trigeminal neuralgia)及非典型顏面痛(atypical facial pain, 目前已改稱 persistent idiopathic facial pain, PIFP)的描述，哪些是正確的？ Trigeminal neuralgia Persistent idiopathic facial pain (1) 通常是間歇性疼痛 通常是持續性疼痛 (2) 常見影響兩個以上 通常僅限於單一明確神經 dermatome dermatome (3) 電擊痛或針刺痛較多 燒灼痛或 aching pain 比例較高 (4) 和三叉神經的血管壓迫可 和 Multiple sclerosis 關聯性高 能有關 (5) 男性較多 女性較多","options":["(1), (2), (3)","(1), (3)","(2), (3), (5)","(1), (4)","(3), (4), (5)"],"officialAnswer":"B","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 B（1、3）。典型三叉神經痛是短暫電擊／刺痛、通常間歇發作；PIFP 常為持續性、難明確定位的鈍痛或灼痛，所以 (1)、(3) 對。(2) PIFP 通常不符合單一清楚神經皮節；(4) classical TN 與血管壓迫有關，但 MS 是 secondary TN 的原因之一，不是 PIFP 典型強關聯；(5) TN 並非男性較多，PIFP 也常見女性，整項不對。","officialNote":"Reference: table 66.1","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":6,"parseWarning":["比較表請以附圖的原始排版為準"],"imageData":"data:image/png;base64,","imageAlt":"114 年第 16 題原始頁面，三叉神經痛與持續性特發性顏面痛比較表","importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-17","year":114,"number":17,"topic":"未分類","text":"關於治療 opioid use disorder 藥物的敘述何者有誤?","options":["Naltrexone 是 mu-opioid agonist，可以用來治療 opioid use disorder","Naltrexone 也可以用來治療 alcohol use disorder","使用 Naltrexone 常見的副作用為頭痛、噁心、頭暈、疲勞、鎮定、與焦慮","Buprenorphine 有 partial agonist 作用，對於中樞神經與呼吸抑制作用有天花板效應(ceiling effect)","Buprenorphine 採用舌下劑型、黏膜劑型為主，來治療 opioid use disorder，主要是因為口 服吸收差以及肝臟的首度效應(first-pass effect)"],"officialAnswer":"A","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 A。Naltrexone 是 opioid receptor **antagonist**，可在適當戒斷與醫療監測下治療 OUD，也用於 alcohol use disorder（B），故 A 說 μ agonist 錯。C 所列惡心、頭痛等可見；D buprenorphine 為 μ partial agonist 且呼吸抑制呈相對 ceiling，但與鎮靜藥合用仍可能危險；E 因 first-pass 效應明顯，OUD 常使用舌下／口腔黏膜製劑。","officialNote":"","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":7,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-18","year":114,"number":18,"topic":"未分類","text":"在考科藍文獻回顧(Cochrane review)治療下背痛實證方面，以下敘述何者有誤?","options":["Paracetamol 對於急性下背痛與安慰劑相比，並沒有得到更好的結果","長期使用 opioids 對於慢性下背痛是安全並且有效的","Radiofrequency denervation 目前沒有高品質的證據顯示對於慢性下背痛病人有好的治療 效果","針灸相對沒治療或是其他中醫治療，對於下背痛的疼痛改善是比較有效的","合併整脊療法是稍微能夠改善急性或亞急性下背疼痛"],"officialAnswer":"B","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 B。長期 opioid 用於慢性非癌性下背痛，長期獲益證據有限且有依賴、過量、跌倒、內分泌副作用等，不能聲稱『安全並有效』。A 急性非特異性下背痛 acetaminophen 研究未明顯優於安慰劑；C RF 證據與病人選案有爭議，2025 BMJ 指引對慢性非癌性脊椎痛介入程序提出強烈反對建議；D 針灸與 E 脊椎操作的效益視對照、時間與結局而異，不能過度外推。","officialNote":"","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"},{"title":"BMJ 2025 chronic spinal interventions guideline","url":"https://www.bmj.com/content/388/bmj-2024-079970"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":7,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-19","year":114,"number":19,"topic":"未分類","text":"關於 spinal cord stimulation(SCS)，何者有誤？","options":["除了 traditional tonic stimulation 外，還有 burst 或 high frequency 等較新的 waveform","Postlaminectomy pain syndrome 是常見的 SCS indication","Visceral pain (例如 interstitial cystitis, chronic pancreatitis, chronic pelvic pain 等)依照目前 臨床實證，並不建議使用 SCS 治療","Postlaminectomy pain syndrome 的病人中，經過越多次脊椎手術的病人，預後越差","Trial lead implantation 一般建議的時間約為一週"],"officialAnswer":"C","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 C（但需註明證據侷限）。SCS 已有 tonic、burst、高頻等 waveform（A），對部分 persistent spinal pain syndrome／postlaminectomy neuropathic pain 可考慮（B）；多次脊椎手術預後往往較差（D），trial 常約 5–7 日（E）。Visceral pain 的 SCS 證據較少且多為選擇性病例，但直接宣稱『不建議使用』也過於絕對；應區分試驗性個案應用與標準適應症。","officialNote":"Reference: Ch96","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":7,"parseWarning":["visceral SCS 證據有限，不等於全部情境均不建議"],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-20","year":114,"number":20,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which of the following principal sensory functions in nociceptive afferents terminating as free nerve endings is wrong?","options":["transduction of external or internal chemical or physical stimuli into generator potentials","transformation of a generator potential into an action potential","propagation of the action potential toward the central nervous system.","release of neurotransmitters and neuromodulators into the superficial dorsal horn of the spinal cord or brainstem","All of the above are correct descriptions"],"officialAnswer":"E","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 E。傷害感受初級傳入神經可將外界刺激 transduce 為 generator potential（A），達閾值後產生動作電位（B），沿軸突傳入 CNS（C），並在脊髓背角／腦幹釋放 glutamate、神經肽等（D）。A–D 都是功能，故 E 原意是『沒有錯誤敘述』；注意題幹雖問 wrong，選項 E 卻寫全對，屬試題常見邏輯表述方式。","officialNote":"考題出處：page 273, FIGURE 3.1, Chapter 3. CHAPTER 3 Peripheral Pain Mechanisms and Nociceptor Sensitization","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":7,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-21","year":114,"number":21,"topic":"未分類","text":"以下何者不是目前三叉神經痛常使用的治療方式？","options":["Medical therapy: carbamazepine or oxcarbamazepine","Radiofrequency denervation/neuromodulation","Percutaneous gangliolysis with glycerol","Vagus nerve block","Microvascular decompression"],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 D。三叉神經痛第一線通常 carbamazepine／oxcarbazepine（A）；難治者可考慮 Gasserian RF、glycerol rhizolysis、balloon compression 或 microvascular decompression（B/C/E）。Vagus nerve block 並非三叉神經痛的標準治療選項。手術選擇與影像中血管壓迫、年齡、共病及感覺併發症風險有關。","officialNote":"Reference: Ch 66, Treatment","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":8,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-22","year":114,"number":22,"topic":"未分類","text":"關於周邊神經手術的敘述何者有誤？","options":["周邊神經切除術基本考量就是去除製造疼痛的神經與切除不正常的神經傷害(如 neuroma)","部分內分泌與風濕疾病是與增加周邊神經纏套(entrapment)風險相關，例如糖尿病","周邊神經纏套(entrapment)除了來自組織壓迫外，可能與神經缺血也有關係","診斷 sympathetically maintained pain 有一定診斷標準，例如皮膚顏色改變等等","sympathetically maintained pain 可能與 A、C 神經傷害感受器有關"],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 D。Sympathetically maintained pain（SMP）是臨床疼痛機制描述，不能只憑皮膚變色、溫差等外觀定成『有明確診斷標準』；這些徵象亦可能見於其他病況。A 神經瘤切除可作選定病患治療，B 糖尿病增加 entrapment 風險，C 長期機械壓迫可導致缺血，E 交感相關痛覺與初級感覺纖維互動，均可能成立。","officialNote":"","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":8,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-23","year":114,"number":23,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which of the following opioid is a μ-Opioid receptor partial agonist?","options":["Oxymorphone","Buprenorphine","Nalbuphine","Pentazocine","Methadone"],"officialAnswer":"B","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 B。Buprenorphine 對 μ-opioid receptor 具有高親和力的 partial agonist 活性，是鎮痛與 OUD 治療重要藥物。Oxymorphone 和 methadone（A/E）為 μ agonists；nalbuphine 與 pentazocine（C/D）屬混合 agonist–antagonist 性質，不能與 buprenorphine 的 μ partial agonism 等同。","officialNote":"","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":8,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-24","year":114,"number":24,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which of the statement about Epidural Steroid Injections(ESIs) is wrong?","options":["Adverse events with caudal ESIs are uncommon but do occur, including transient central steroid effects (flushing, nonpositional headache, insomnia), transient blindness, retinal necrosis, chemical meningitis, arachnoiditis, epidural hematoma, and epidural abscess.","Adverse events with interlaminar ESIs may be segregated into major (neurologic injury, intraspinal hemorrhage, spinal infections, chemical meningitis, paraplegia, and transient blindness) and minor events (vasovagal syncope, dural puncture, acute systemic steroid effects, contrast reactions).","According to the evidence, there are still some neurologic events, intraspinal hematomas, or infections if transforaminal ESIs are performed using Spine Intervention Society procedural guidelines","Adverse events with transforaminal ESIs are vasovagal reactions, central steroid effects, and transient increased pain.","For transforaminal ESIs, nonparticulate steroid dexamethasone are safer because intra-arterial injection of particulate steroids may cause spinal cord infarction. Dexamethasone, however, is known to precipitate into particles if mixed with ropivacaine. P.1613, 1615, 1619."],"officialAnswer":"C","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"disputed","explanation":"官方 C 具有爭議：若按題面字義『即使遵循 SIS 安全指引，仍有少量神經學、血腫或感染併發症』，此句其實是合理風險表述，不能說錯。A/B 列出 rare but serious caudal、interlaminar ESI 事件；D 列出 TFESI 常見短期事件；E 顆粒 steroid 動脈栓塞與 ropivacaine 混合 dexamethasone 可能析晶風險均有文獻。故官方 C 作答鍵需保留，但此題可能沒有明確唯一錯誤選項。","officialNote":"","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"},{"title":"2024 ESI particulate vs nonparticulate safety review","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/39011664/"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":8,"parseWarning":["C 文字表示遵循安全指引仍可能有併發症，不應視為必然錯誤"],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-25","year":114,"number":25,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which of the statement about Intrathecal(IT) Opioid Treatment is wrong?","options":["Because of the small volume of distribution of morphine in the CSF, a dose of IT morphine yields significantly higher CSF concentration than that which occurs when given epidurally where significant vascular absorption occurs.","IT hydromorphone is approximately 5 to 6 times more potent than IT morphine and is somewhat more lipophilic, which is associated with more side effects than IT morphine.","Opioid-induced hyperalgesia often appears in those receiving long-term IT therapy with opioids. This is manifest as hyperalgesia, an exaggerated pain response to a stimuli that would normally be considered mildly noxious, like a pinprick and allodynia, pain that is produced by a normally nonnoxious stimulus, like light touch.","Common diagnosis treated with intrathecal therapy includes axial neck or back pain (not a surgical candidate), failed back surgery syndrome, abdominal/pelvic pain, extremity pain, complex regional pain syndrome (CRPS), trunk pain, cancer pain (direct invasion or chemotherapy related).","For implantation of an Intrathecal drug delivery systems (IDDSs), needle entry should be caudal to L1 vertebral level, ideally at L2–L3 or L3–L4, because the spinal cord terminates at the T12 or L1."],"officialAnswer":"B","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 B。IT hydromorphone 較 morphine 脂溶性高，劑量換算與副作用譜需依病人調整；不能僅憑『更脂溶』就斷言副作用一定更多，因此 B 不妥。A IT morphine 在 CSF 可形成高濃度；C 長期 IT opioid 仍可能產生耐受、OIH／allodynia；D 慢性難治痛與癌痛為部分 IDDS 適應症；E 操作一般避開 conus medullaris，但成人脊髓下端解剖變異存在，勿誤以為一律終止 T12–L1。","officialNote":"P.1625, 1626, 1629, 1633","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":9,"parseWarning":["IT 脊髓終止位置與劑量風險有個體差異"],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-26","year":114,"number":26,"topic":"未分類","text":"A patient suffered from chronic low back pain with radiating to buttock, poster lateral thigh and lateral aspect of lower leg. Muscle weakness was observed in the extensor hallucis longus and tibialis anterior. Which lumbosacral root compression is the most likely?","options":["L2 root compression","L3 root compression","L4 root compression","L5 root compression","S1 root compression"],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 D。臀／大腿後外側到小腿外側放射痛，加 EHL 與 tibialis anterior 無力，最符合 L5 radiculopathy。L2–L3 主要涉及股前側，L4 偏膝伸／內側小腿，S1 則偏足蹠屈與跟腱反射。題目與 115 年第 27 題高度重複；應以 dermatomes、myotomes、反射三者整合記憶。","officialNote":"","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":10,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-27","year":114,"number":27,"topic":"未分類","text":"有關 Post-stroke pain 之疼痛症狀類型中，下列描述何者最不適合？","options":["Central post-stroke pain 屬於 neuropathic type","Shoulder pain 不屬於 neuropathic type","Musculoskeletal pain 不屬於 neuropathic type","Headache 屬於 neuropathic pain","Spasticity 不屬於 neuropathic type"],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 D。Central post-stroke pain 是因中樞感覺路徑受損的 neuropathic pain（A）；卒中後肩痛（B）、肌筋膜痛（C）、痙攣相關痛（E）多屬其他疼痛機制。一般 headache 不能僅因病人曾中風就分類為 neuropathic pain，D 錯；仍需排除血管性或其他急性頭痛紅旗。","officialNote":"","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":10,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-28","year":114,"number":28,"topic":"未分類","text":"對於催眠,雖然很多人只當它是類似一種魔術表演,但目前越來越多研究證實催眠確實有止 痛效果,那麼以下所列疾病或狀況是目前有較多研究證實催眠有效的?","options":["Burns","Pediatric Pain","Cancer","Osteoarthritis","以上皆是"],"officialAnswer":"E","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 E。Hypnosis 可作為輔助疼痛控制，文獻涉及燒傷換藥、兒童處置疼痛、癌痛與骨關節炎等（A–D）。然而研究設計、對照介入與效應大小高度異質，並非所有情境都有高品質、確定性同等的效果；實務上應與標準藥物與復健併用，而非取代必要處置。","officialNote":"(Chapter 86 Review of Research Studies According to Pain Problems or Situations)","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":10,"parseWarning":["hypnosis 在各病況的實證強度不一，『較多研究證實』不可等同高確定性"],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-29","year":114,"number":29,"topic":"未分類","text":"以下那個選項不是發生 local anesthetics systemic toxicity (LAST)時的正確處理?","options":["Suppress seizures: Benzodiazepines preferred","使用 amiodarone 做為第一線 antiarrhythmic","避免使用 calcium channel blockers, beta blockers","若使用 lipid emulsion 解毒,病人回復 hemodynamic stable 即立即停止繼續給予 lipid emulsion","Maximum dose lipid emulsion 大約 12 mL/kg IV"],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":"D","verified":"verified","explanation":"官方 D。ASRA LAST 復甦建議中，痙攣優先 benzodiazepines（A），應避免 β-blocker、calcium channel blocker（C）與 vasopressin；生命危及時使用 20% lipid emulsion，血流動力學穩定後**至少再持續 15 分鐘**，而非立即停止，故 D 錯。最大累積劑量約 12 mL/kg（E）；惡性心律不整管理需依 LAST 專用流程與病人狀況，不能照搬一般 ACLS。","officialNote":"","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"},{"title":"ASRA LAST 2020 checklist","url":"https://asra.com/docs/default-source/guidelines-articles/local-anesthetic-systemic-toxicity-rgb.pdf"},{"title":"NCBI LAST clinical summary: amiodarone, lipid rescue","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK499964/?report=classic"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":10,"parseWarning":["LAST 過程中 amiodarone 等抗心律不整藥須依專門指引，不等同所有情境的第一線"],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-30","year":114,"number":30,"topic":"未分類","text":"Neuropathic pain 有多種不同原因,治療藥物的選擇必須依照病因決定,請問下列敘述,何者 錯誤?","options":["Amitriptyline 對 Spinal cord injury 的 neuropathic pain 治療效果不佳","Amitriptyline 對 phantom limb pain 的治療效果不佳","Venlafaxine 對 postmastectomy syndrome 的治療效果不佳","Selective Serotonin and Norepinephrine Reuptake Inhibitors 治療 painful diabetic neuropathic pain 的 NNT (number needed to treat)比 TCA 小","Selective Serotonin and Norepinephrine Reuptake Inhibitors(SNRI)一般比 Selective Serotonin Reuptake Inhibitors(SSRI)對 neuropathic pain 的治療效果好"],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 D。某些舊 meta-analysis 中 diabetic neuropathic pain 的 TCAs 估計 NNT 較低，不能說 SNRI 類一定更低；但 NNT 受不同人群與治療定義影響，跨試驗直接比較不穩健。A～C 是個別疾病／藥物 RCT 結果，不代表一律無效；E SNRI 對神經病變痛的實證通常比 SSRI 充足。AAN 現行指引允許 TCA、SNRI、gabapentinoids 等多種一線選項。","officialNote":"(Chapter 81 table 80.2 80.3 及關於 SSRI 的敘述)","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"},{"title":"AAN 2022 Neuropathy treatment guideline","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/34965987/"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":11,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-31","year":114,"number":31,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which of the statement about dynamic mechanical allodynia is wrong?","options":["it is a positive symptom of neuropathic pain resulting from light tactile stimuli that would never be considered noxious in the absence of nervous system injury","this phenomenon reflects activity in low-threshold afferents that signal pain as a result of changes in the central nervous system as if they were nociceptive afferents","following peripheral nerve injury, a subpopulation of putative non-nociceptive afferents begins to express calcitonin gene-related peptide","one possible mechanism involves sprouting of non-nociceptive afferent, e.g., A-β afferents, into superficial laminae I and II of the dorsal horn to enable low threshold drive of nociceptive dorsal horn neurons but remains largely unsubstantiated","central sensitization has been suggested as a result of dynamic mechanical allodynia, reflecting activity in low-threshold afferents that signal pain as a result of changes in the central nervous system, but is still debated"],"officialAnswer":"C","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 C。Dynamic mechanical allodynia 常由低閾值 Aβ mechanoreceptive inputs 在脊髓／中樞敏化後引起疼痛（A/B）。C 說部分非傷害感受纖維在受傷後開始表現 CGRP，並非教材主張的典型周邊神經重塑機制。D Aβ sprouting 進入表淺背角是歷史模型，真人證據仍不牢固；E 中樞敏化與 allodynia 的因果機制仍有討論。實際上 peripheral phenotypic switch 的證據也依模型而異。","officialNote":"Source: P34, Chapter 3: Peripheral pain mechanisms and nociceptor sensitization. In: Bonica's Management of Pain. Fifth Edition. Edited by Ballantyne JC, Fishman SM, and Rathmell JP. 2019. Wolters Kluwer. Following peripheral nerve injury that a subpopulation of putative nonnociceptive afferents begins to express the neuropeptide, substance P (Reference: Noguchi K, Dubner R, De Leon M, et al. Axotomy induces preprotachykinin gene expression in a subpopulation of dorsal root ganglion neurons. J Neurosci Res 1994;37(5):596–603.)","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":11,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-32","year":114,"number":32,"topic":"未分類","text":"The operational guidelines for disk stimulation are as following, except which?","options":["Stimulating the disk must reproduce the patient’s pain (known as a concordant response).","Stimulation of adjacent disks does not reproduce pain.","Pain is evoked at low thresholds of stimulation: less than 20 psi (0.14 kPa).","The evoked pain is clinically significant, that is, rated as greater than 7 out of 10 on a numerical pain rating scale or its equivalent.","Disk stimulation differs in that its emphasis is more on morphologic changes of the disk than the patient’s response to stimulation of the disk with injections of contrast medium or normal saline. P. 1463"],"officialAnswer":"E","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 E。Provocative discography 強調刺激時是否再現病人的熟悉疼痛（A）、鄰近對照椎間盤不痛（B）、低壓閾值例如 ≤20 psi（C）與具臨床意義的強度（D），而不只是造影顯示的形態改變。E 把重點改成單純 morphologic abnormality，因此錯。Discography 有偽陽性與誘發不適風險，須嚴格選案並理解證據限制。","officialNote":"","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":12,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-33","year":114,"number":33,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which of the statement about disk degeneration and internal disk disruption is wrong?","options":["According to The grading of radial fissures in internal disk disruption, Grade III fissures reach the outer third of the anulus and become grade IV fissures if they extend circumferentially around the outer anulus.","High-intensity zones (HIZ) in the posterior anulus represent the cross-sectional appearance of a circumferential fissure. They occur in 70% to 80% of patients with chronic low back pain and correlate with the affected disk being painful.","As the nucleus degrades, it is no longer able to retain water and loses its hydrostatic properties. Pressures within the nucleus become irregular and reduced.","Degenerative Injury results in the liberation of phospholipases (PLAs), which in turn act on arachidonic acid to produce prostaglandins (PGs) and leukotrienes (LTs). Attracted macrophages release superoxide and cytokines such as tumor necrosis factor alpha (TNFα), interleukins (IL), and interferon (IFN).","Modic lesions occur in the spongiosa of the vertebral body above an abnormal disk P.1643-1645"],"officialAnswer":"B","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 B。MRI 後方 annular high-intensity zone（HIZ）與 fissure 有關，但不是 70–80% 慢性下背痛病人都會有、也不能單憑 HIZ 判定疼痛來源，故 B 不正確。A fissure 分級到 outer annulus 與後續環狀延伸；C nucleus 退化後失水；D 發炎介質與 cytokines 可參與 disc degeneration；E Modic 變化出現在椎體終板附近骨髓。影像病變不等於臨床疼痛診斷。","officialNote":"","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":12,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-34","year":114,"number":34,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which of the statement about thermal radiofrequency (RF) is right?","options":["The objective of RF lesioning is to deliver sufficient heating power into biologic tissue such that the tissue temperature is raised above the “lethal temperature” range of 45° to 50° C.","Because the tissue temperature drops slowly with distance from the electrode, the lesion is not too limited in size beyond the surface of the electrode","Once the electrode surface temperature reaches 80° C, lesion size increases with time as the temperature is maintained. Most of the increase in size occurs within 20 seconds, but an appreciable growth continues between 20 and 60 seconds.","If an electrode is placed parallel to a nerve, it incorporates a small volume of the nerve along a lesser length.","RF medial branch neurotomy is an ideal treatment for nonspecific spinal pain. It is applicable more than pain only mediated by one or more medial branches of the dorsal rami. P.1655, 1656, 1664"],"officialAnswer":"A","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 A。Continuous thermal RF 的目的為加熱靶組織到足以形成凝固性神經損傷的溫度，常以約 80°C、60–90 秒等作介入參數，實際 lesion 視電極、溫度、時間、組織而變。B 電極外溫度隨距離快速下降、病灶受限；C 20 秒至 60 秒的增長幅度敘述與原文假設需核對，不能視為固定定律；D 平行神經可涵蓋較長節段；E facet RF 不適用一切 nonspecific low back pain。","officialNote":"","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":12,"parseWarning":["題目 A/C 針對 lesion 溫度與時間的量化敘述容易隨設定改變"],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-35","year":114,"number":35,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which of the substances delivered spinally can not reverse or block antinociceptive tolerance as well as opioid-induced hyperalgesia?","options":["NMDA receptor antagonists","phosphokinase C inhibitors","cyclo-oxygenase inhibitors","5-HT3 receptors antagonist","differing opioid receptor subtype agonists/antagonists"],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 D（依 Bonica 教材機轉分類）。Spinal NMDA antagonism、PKC inhibition、COX inhibition 及不同 opioid receptor 活性調控（A/B/C/E）均被研究用以減輕 tolerance／OIH。題目把 5-HT3 antagonism（D）列為不能逆轉者，但這類神經傳遞涉及複雜下行促痛，應視試驗與模型，不能把結論視為臨床定律；若要臨床用藥，仍需查實證。","officialNote":"考題出處： page 369, CHAPTER 5 Modulation of Spinal Nociceptive Processing","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":13,"parseWarning":["脊髓 5-HT3 receptor 對 OIH 的作用複雜，不能視為臨床定論"],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-36","year":114,"number":36,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which description below for opioids is wrong?","options":["opioid receptors are G protein related receptor complexes","Spinal effects arising from supraspinal actions of μ-opioid receptors agonists are via descending GABAB receptor activation","μ-opioid receptors agonists act presynaptically on primary afferents to inhibit release of excitatory neurotransmitters","μ-opioid receptors agonists act postsynaptically to directly inhibit second-order neurons","All of the above description for opioids are all correct"],"officialAnswer":"B","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 B。μ-opioid receptor 為 Gi/o-coupled GPCR（A），可在 presynaptic terminal 抑制鈣離子內流及 glutamate／neuropeptide 釋放（C），也可 postsynaptically 增強 K+ 傳導使神經元超極化（D）。Supraspinal opioid analgesia 涉及 PAG–RVM 的下降路徑與 GABA interneuron disinhibition，不能簡化為下降 GABAB receptor activation（B）。E 因 B 錯而不成立。","officialNote":"考題出處：page 334-335, CHAPTER 4 Substrates of Spinal Cord Nociceptive Processing","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":13,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-37","year":114,"number":37,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which of the following functional imaging techniques was applied for the study of pain?","options":["positron emission tomography (PET)","functional magnetic resonance imaging (fMRI)","near-infrared spectroscopy (NIRS)","magnetoencephalography (MEG)","All of the above are applied for the study of pain."],"officialAnswer":"E","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 E。PET、fMRI、NIRS 以及 MEG 均可研究疼痛相關腦活動（A–D），但所量測分別是代謝／血流、BOLD、血氧訊號或磁場變化，不等同直接讀取主觀疼痛強度。多模態研究應控制期待、注意、運動、藥物、個體解剖與多重比較。","officialNote":"考題出處：Page, 378-379, CHAPTER 6 Supraspinal Mechanisms of Pain and Nociception, Section Functional Imaging of Pain in Humans","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":13,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-38","year":114,"number":38,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which of the description is not attributed to the NMDA receptors?","options":["both voltage-gated and ligand-gated","allow permeability to sodium and calcium ions","sustained activation can produce alterations in intracellular second messenger functions of potassium","Magnesium ions act to block the channels of NMDA receptors","All of the above are correct description for the function of NMDA receptors"],"officialAnswer":"C","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 C。NMDA receptor 要 glutamate/glycine 等配體與足夠膜去極化解除 Mg2+ block，因而兼有 ligand 與 voltage dependence（A/D）；通道主要通透 Ca2+、Na+、K+（B）。C 將 NMDA 長期活化後的 second messenger alteration 錯誤歸結於 potassium，關鍵是 **Ca2+-dependent intracellular signaling**，涉及 PKC、CaMKII 等。E 既含 C 也不能為真。","officialNote":"考題出處：Page, 329, CHAPTER 4 Substrates of Spinal Cord Nociceptive Processing Section: Excitatory Amino Acids","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":14,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-39","year":114,"number":39,"topic":"未分類","text":"下列有關 fibromyalgia (FM, 纖維肌痛症)之敘述，何者較不正確?","options":["女性比男性發生率高且更痛","病人常有 somatic 疼痛問題，如慢性頭痛、下背痛及顳顎關節痛","有 FM 的病人，伴隨有 anxiety 的比率可高達近 5 成","有 FM 病人其 cerebrospinal fluid (CSF)進行分析，顯示內生性嗎啡量減少","FM 病人對疼痛之敏感性較高，可能和特定基因有關"],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 D。Fibromyalgia 常有多重身體疼痛與情緒共病（B/C），中樞疼痛調節、遺傳及神經傳遞物質差異可能參與（E）。D 說 CSF endogenous opioids 必然下降不符合教材中神經生化結果，部分研究反而有升高或受體活性異常。A 女性診斷率在傳統臨床樣本較高，但性別差異受診斷標準／轉介影響，不能視為固有生物定律。","officialNote":"(P405, 465, P497, P1755)","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":14,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-40","year":114,"number":40,"topic":"未分類","text":"下列有關 fibromyalgia (FM, 纖維肌痛症) 之治療藥物中，何者較不適當(證據力等級較低) ?","options":["Tricyclic compounds, 如 Amitriptyline","SNRIs, 如 Duloxetine","Gabapentinoids, 如 Gabapentin, Pregabalin","SSRIs, 如 Fluoxetine, sertraline","Opioids, 如 Morphine, Oxycodone"],"officialAnswer":"E","verifiedAnswer":"E","verified":"verified","explanation":"官方 E。Fibromyalgia 治療核心應包含規律分級有氧／肌力運動、睡眠與心理社會介入；amitriptyline（A）、duloxetine 等 SNRI（B）、pregabalin（C）有部分病患可受益；SSRI（D）止痛效果較弱且證據不一。Morphine／oxycodone 等強效 opioids（E）長期獲益不確定且副作用、依賴風險高，現行指引多不建議。","officialNote":"(Table 36-3, P1758)","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"},{"title":"HAS 2025 Fibromyalgia guideline","url":"https://www.has-sante.fr/jcms/p_3689474/fr/fibromyalgia-in-adults-diagnostic-management-and-treatment-strategy-guideline-2025"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":14,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-41","year":114,"number":41,"topic":"未分類","text":"Spinal cord injury (脊髓損傷, SCI )病人若伴隨 abdominal visceral pain，於 SCI 發生後幾年， 其頻率最高?","options":["3 年","5 年","10 年","20 年","30 年"],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 D（20 年）。題目引用特定 SCI 長期追蹤資料，腹部內臟痛（可能與腸道、泌尿、生理功能變化有關）在受傷後長期可能增加；原卷指定 20 年最常見。A 3、B 5、C 10、E 30 年沒有同一來源支持。此時間點不是生理學上的必然峰值，研究族群與疼痛定義不同可能不同。","officialNote":"(P1910-1911)","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":14,"parseWarning":["20 年發生率最高為單一歷史研究估計，需取得原始統計"],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-42","year":114,"number":42,"topic":"未分類","text":"Spinal cord injury (脊髓損傷, SCI )病人若伴隨有 spasticity，下列何種藥物使用會降低 seizure threshold，尤其當病人伴隨有 seizure 問題時要特別注意?","options":["Acetaminophen","NSAIDs","Tramadol","Baclofen","SNRIs drugs"],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"disputed","explanation":"官方 D，但題目存在競爭答案。Baclofen 使用不當、突然停藥或 IT baclofen withdrawal 可造成嚴重反跳痙攣、癲癇、橫紋肌溶解等（D），須緩慢調整及避免中斷；**Tramadol（C）同樣明確會降低 seizure threshold**，尤其高劑量或合併抗憂鬱劑。若題幹只問『何藥會降低閾值』，C 也能成立。原卷指定 D，臨床應兩者都留意。","officialNote":"(P1923-1925)","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"},{"title":"DailyMed tramadol seizure risk","url":"https://www.dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/fda/fdaDrugXsl.cfm?setid=8ec4e4e5-a56e-4198-8428-6b770b9bf27d&type=display"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":15,"parseWarning":["Tramadol 也明確降低 seizure threshold，存在競爭答案"],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-43","year":114,"number":43,"topic":"未分類","text":"在癌症病人若伴隨有 Myofascial Pain，或是 Fibromyalgia 病人確切進行檢查病人是否有 muscle tenderness-tender point，請問學理上來說要在病人身上的檢查部位施予多少 kg per square centimeter?","options":["1","2","3","4","5"],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"disputed","explanation":"官方 D，但單位需校正。1990 ACR fibromyalgia tender-point examination 指壓約 **4 kg force**（相當於按壓至檢查者指甲床變白），非嚴格每平方公分 4 kg 的壓強標準。A–C 壓力通常低於該舊式測試操作設定，E 較高。2010／2016 ACR 診斷已不再必須數 18 處 tender points，而改重視 WPI、SSS 和症狀分布。","officialNote":"((P1989)","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"},{"title":"Tender point survey: 4 kg force","url":"https://www.fmaware.org/the-manual-tender-point-survey/"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":15,"parseWarning":["4 kg 為壓力測試 force 而非 kg/cm²，單位錯誤"],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-44","year":114,"number":44,"topic":"未分類","text":"About chemical neurolytic nerve blocks, which one of following statements is wrong?","options":["Phenol or ethanol is usually used for chemical denervation.","The duration of these blocks is often disappointingly brief.","They may induce deafferentation-neuropathic type pain.","They are often indicated for patients with chronic pain and a normal life expectancy.","They can be used in patients with advanced cancer disease."],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 D。Phenol 與 alcohol 可做化學性 neurolysis（A），止痛可能較預期短且會再生（B），也有 deafferentation neuropathic pain 風險（C）。因此通常保留給嚴重難治癌痛或特殊狀況（E），不是對正常預期壽命的非癌慢性痛常規使用，故 D 不正確。具神經損傷永久風險，必須嚴格告知與選案。","officialNote":"考題出處：Textbook of Pain, Chapter 33, p509.","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":15,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-45","year":114,"number":45,"topic":"未分類","text":"About image-guided lumbar sympathetic block, which the following indication is not proper?","options":["Sympathetically maintained pain","Reflex sympathetic dystrophy","Phantom low limb pain","Raynaud’s disease","Chronic pancreatitis"],"officialAnswer":"E","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 E。Lumbar sympathetic block 針對下肢 sympathetically maintained pain、部分 CRPS／舊稱 reflex sympathetic dystrophy、某些缺血性末梢痛（例如 Raynaud's）可有角色（A/B/D）；phantom limb pain 中若懷疑交感維持成分可試行（C），但不是通用療法。Chronic pancreatitis 主要涉及上腹內臟神經途徑，應考慮 celiac／splanchnic 相關策略，非腰交感神經阻斷。","officialNote":"考題出處：P511-512","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":15,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-46","year":114,"number":46,"topic":"未分類","text":"下列幾項關於疼痛名詞的定義或說明，依照 Bonica’s Management of Pain 5th ed 或疼痛學 理，哪一項是錯誤？","options":["Anesthesia dolorosa: Spontaneous pain in an area or region that is anesthetic","Catastrophizing: A cognitive and emotional process which can be an important predictor of negative response to both acute and chronic pain","Chronic widespread pain includes nonradicular back pain, fibromyalgia, irritable bowel syndrome, pelvic pain, tension-type headache, and temporomandibular disorders (TMD).","Conditioned pain modulation: a mechanism can be assessed by measuring tonic pain response after a conditioned phasic pain stimulus","Hyperpathia: A painful syndrome characterized by an abnormally painful reaction to a stimulus"],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 D。CPM 的標準示範通常以持續性 conditioning pain 刺激另一個相對短暫的 test stimulus，題目 D 把兩者顛倒。A anesthesia dolorosa、B catastrophizing、E hyperpathia 定義大致相符；C 以常見 chronic overlapping pain conditions 作例子，但不能等同每個都符合嚴格 widespread pain 診斷標準。與 115 年第 1 題幾乎相同。","officialNote":"(考題出處：Bonica's Management of Pain Fifth Edition; Chap 2, page 229-231; (D) Conditioned pain modulation: a mechanism can be assessed by measuring “phasic” pain response after a conditioned “tonic” pain stimulus)","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":16,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-47","year":114,"number":47,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which of the following statement concerning “muscle pain” is least likely?","options":["Muscle pain is distinct from cutaneous pain.","Muscle pain is one of the most common pain complaints.","Muscle nociceptors are free nerve endings that are connected to the central nervous system.","Most nociceptors cannot be excited by algesic agents, including bradykinin, serotonin.","In damaged muscle, the nociceptors have a lowered mechanical threshold."],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 D。Muscle nociceptors 能受 bradykinin、serotonin、ATP、酸化等 algesic mediators 敏化或直接活化，所以 D 說『大多不能被這些物質興奮』錯。A 肌肉痛與皮膚痛感不同，B 肌痛常見，C 感覺自由神經末梢連接 CNS，E 受傷肌肉的機械閾值可下降，均合乎肌肉周邊敏化。","officialNote":"","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":16,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-48","year":114,"number":48,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which of the following diagnostic tests that aid in the diagnosis of complex regional pain syndrome?","options":["Bone scintigraphy","Plain radiography and X-ray bone densitometry","Quantitative sensory testing","Skin temperature measurement","All of above"],"officialAnswer":"E","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 E。Bone scintigraphy（A）可見局部骨代謝改變，X-ray／骨密度（B）可見晚期骨質變化，QST（C）可評估 sensory dysfunction，皮膚測溫（D）可提示自主神經改變；都可**輔助** CRPS 評估。但 CRPS 應依 Budapest clinical criteria 診斷、排除其他原因；沒有一項檢查單獨具確診效力。E 表示 A–D 皆可能提供輔助資訊。","officialNote":"","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":16,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-49","year":114,"number":49,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which one of the following statement about the pathophysiology of herpes zoster is wrong?","options":["Herpes zoster most commonly manifests in the distribution of a single dorsal sensory or cranial nerve ganglion.","Why the reactivation of virus occurs in one ganglion when latent virus is present throughout the patient’s sensory ganglia is clear.","Declining cellular immunity is a major risk factor for reactivation of the virus, which is thought to occur when cell-mediated immunity falls below a critical level.","This impression is supported by evidence that even individuals with adequate levels of serum antibodies to varicella-zoster virus (VZV) antigen can, over time, exhibit T cells with reduced ability to proliferate and defend against VZV infections.","Cell-mediated immunity appears to play a crucial role in preventing reactivation of latent VZV."],"officialAnswer":"B","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 B。帶狀疱疹常沿單側感覺神經節支配皮節出現（A），VZV-specific cellular immunity 下降會增加再活化風險（C/E），即使血清抗體仍存在，T cell 功能也可能下降（D）。為何潛伏 VZV 在某一神經節先再活化仍未完全明瞭，所以 B 的『is clear』錯。與 115 年第 2 題相同。","officialNote":"考題出處：Bonica's Management of Pain, 5e, p. 375.","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":17,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-114-50","year":114,"number":50,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which of the following is the acceptable statement about neurodestructive RF lesions?","options":["These temperatures are resulted from friction heat.","The size of RF lesion with 22 gauge RF needle is around with a radius of 5 mm","The heat is generated on the tip of RF needle. The RF needle then heat up the tissues.","The RF permanent neurodestructive lesion is formed when neural temperatures exceed 42 C","All of the above"],"officialAnswer":"A","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 A（依原教材描述）。RF lesioning 以高頻交替電場導致組織離子振盪／摩擦性阻抗加熱，並非由針尖本身單向導熱，A 為最適當敘述；C 說『熱直接在針尖產生、再加熱組織』過度簡化。B lesion 半徑不宜固定當成 5 mm，隨針徑、露出長度、時間、溫度變動；D 42°C 通常不足以形成可靠永久毀損；E 因多項錯不成立。","officialNote":"","sources":[{"title":"114 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"114.pdf","page":17,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"}]);
